WEBVTT

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.550
When the autumn wind started to blow,

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:52.720
Erin officially became a teacher, and new students arrived at Kazalm.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:01.170
Very well, everyone.  There is something I would like you all to promise before starting your new life at Kazalm.

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:05.830
We have a beast-lord named Lilan here, who has a baby in her belly.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:12.180
If you do not have her caretaker Erin-sensei's permission, you cannot go near her, so please keep that in mind.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:16.280
I'm not going to lose.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:24.910
Birth

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:28.480
We'll have class here today.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.490
You can do whatever you'd like until I call you.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.090
Yay!

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.330
Let's go over there!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.200
What are you doing?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.900
Reading a book.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.550
It's a book from Tamuyuan.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.630
Reading a book out here?

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.640
You said we could do what we'd like.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:01.450
I did, but you can play with everyone else, you know?

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.170
I want to study so I don't lose to anyone.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.210
Not to anyone?

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.230
Yes.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:12.070
I won't fail to become a better teacher than you, too.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.200
That's why I have to read a lot of books.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.740
It's great to be studious,

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:22.870
but I don't think the point of studying is to make sure you don't lose to others.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:26.470
I don't want to hear that.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.550
Everyone, gather around!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.010
Does anyone know what that bird eats?

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:42.570
Okay, you.

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:47.270
It's got a long beak, so it eats insects from inside trees.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.230
I'm wrong?

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.110
You're half-right.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:58.170
But the book said it eats insects from inside trees.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:04.140
You're right.  But that bird eats more than insects.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.540
There, take a look.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.390
It's eating berries!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:15.170
It's not written in any books, but it eats berries like that at times, too.

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:21.850
What's written in books is important.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:30.120
But I think the things you see with your eyes, hear with your ears, and what you feel yourself are much more important.

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:39.610
As I've just become a teacher at Kazalm, I want to learn along with all of you.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:46.240
What are you doing?!

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:46.950
This happens every year.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:47.820
Take that!
This happens every year.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.620
It got in my mouth!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:50.540
It's Kazalm's iconic event, isn't it?
It got in my mouth!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.530
It's Kazalm's iconic event, isn't it?

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:52.940
It is?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.520
Shiron.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.630
What's she doing there?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.270
I'm reading a book.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.760
I'll be safe near the teachers.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.420
But you should participate in the class.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.210
I've already seen the condition of the feces.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.080
This class's main point is to observe the condition of the feces, right?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:09.980
Stop it!
This class's main point is to observe the condition of the feces, right?

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.110
I'm surprised you realized that.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.400
If you read the book, it's written there.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.860
Seems like you study a lot.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:25.660
Of course.  I won't lose at becoming the best teacher here.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.410
Erin-sensei.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.020
Please let me take care of a beast-lord.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.770
Taking care of beast-lords is a college student's duty.

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:41.800
I heard Erin-sensei started taking care of one when she was only in her second year of junior high.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:46.030
I have the confidence to start earlier.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:51.800
Why do you want to take care of one so badly?

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.190
<i>Why do you want to study so much?</i>

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:03.550
<i>I want to go to Tamuyuan and become a teacher like you, Father.</i>

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:10.330
<i>At Tamuyuan, girls can't become teachers.</i>

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:13.920
<i>Why not?</i>

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:17.090
<i>We're not of a family that can enroll a girl!</i>

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.670
<i>What...</i>

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:23.930
<i>You said I'm smarter than my older brothers!</i>

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.490
<i>I want to go to Tamuyuan, too.</i>

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:32.370
I want to take care of a beast-lord and prove that I can become a teacher quickly.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.980
You don't have to rush like that.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:41.650
How unfair.

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:46.320
You took care of a beast-lord when you were in your second year of junior high,

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.010
and, as a woman, became a teacher.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.750
I, also...  I, also...

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:55.790
Shiron!

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:56.560
Whoa there.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.610
Is something going on?

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.800
It's very difficult.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.680
Guiding people, you mean?

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:10.500
Yes.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:16.770
Esal-sensei was looking for the troubled-looking Erin-sensei.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.440
There you are.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.870
Thank you very much.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.800
So, what do you think?

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.760
Yes, it's difficult.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.700
There's a student that I'm a little worried about, too...

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.210
I'm sorry, Erin.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:38.000
I wanted to hear about Lilan.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.240
Oh, Lilan?

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.230
We should be expecting the baby soon, right?

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:47.900
Yes.  The baby's moving around a lot inside Lilan's belly.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:48.850
I see.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.130
I might have to start sticking around her.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.690
Let's have Tomura-sensei substitute in your classes.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:57.100
Yes.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.100
I'm very grateful for you.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:06.360
There's nothing greater than being able to watch the birth of a beast-lord up close.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.080
I'm very excited, too!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.300
So, which student is it that you're worried about?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.410
Ah, yes...

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.060
It's the girl named Shiron.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:23.090
The first girl since you and Yuuyan, right?

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.520
What happened?

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:30.260
She said she wants to take care of a beast-lord in order to become a teacher quickly.

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:36.180
She also said it's unfair that I became a teacher even though I'm a woman.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.300
I see.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:43.860
Shiron's father is a teacher at Tamuyuan.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:51.030
Her two older brothers are working as teachers as well, and graduated as valedictorians at Tamuyuan.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:01.080
I've got to study more and make Erin-sensei acknowledge me.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:05.460
<i>Give it back!</i>

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:09.340
<i>You need to begin lessons in preparation for your marriage.</i>

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:13.050
<i>It's best for girls to become brides.</i>

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:17.230
<i>I enjoy studying and learning new things!</i>

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:20.600
<i>I want to become a teacher like my brothers and you, Father!</i>

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.190
<i>Still, it's like I've told you, you can't go to Tamu-</i>

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:25.230
<i>I'll go to Kazalm!</i>

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.460
<i>Kazalm?</i>

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:30.200
<i>I heard the Reverend of the Teachers at Kazalm is a woman.</i>

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:34.280
<i>And another female became a teacher there!</i>

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.290
<i>Really?</i>

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.960
If I read lots of books and study, I'm sure Father will...

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:52.860
Lilan, do you have worries, too?

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:57.060
<i>How unfair.</i>

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.600
<i>You took care of a beast-lord when you were in your second year of junior high,</i>

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.190
<i>and, as a woman, became a teacher.</i>

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.280
Does it hurt?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.070
I'm sorry, Lilan.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.120
You're working hard, too, aren't you?

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:20.010
Erin-sensei's hugging the beast-lord.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.830
I thought beast-lords didn't befriend humans.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.190
That's what it says in the books.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:44.480
Listen up.  If you make the grounds look pretty, the beast-lords will be happy, too.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:45.660
Tomura-sensei.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.200
Where's Erin-sensei?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:54.260
Erin-sensei is working on some other task right now.

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:56.310
Then I guess you'll do.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.950
"D-Do?"

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:02.500
Can Erin-sensei go near a beast-lord without using the mute whistle?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.640
I saw it!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:07.880
Erin-sensei was hugging a beast-lord.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:12.340
The book says beast-lords never befriend humans, right?

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.840
Ah...  regarding that...

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:19.930
I'll just have to ask Erin-sensei!

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:20.910
Wait!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.340
You can't disturb Erin-sensei now!

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:22.800
Sensei!
You can't disturb Erin-sensei now!

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.510
We're done!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.270
G-Great!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.760
You'll drop them if you don't look straight ahead, Mokku!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.850
Perfect timing!

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:33.060
Bring that student back here!

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:39.450
I'm going to tame a beast-lord and become a teacher quickly!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:47.710
<i>It would best for you to marry into a good family rather than to become a teacher at Kazalm.</i>

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:54.690
I can...  I can also...

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.190
No one's here.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.570
It's huge.

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.240
Don't raise your voice.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.240
This girl is just fine!

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.190
Relax, Lilan.

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.860
That's right.  Go back to sleep.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.920
We'll back out slowly.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.680
Great, looks like you're not hurt at all.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:23.350
It seemed like that beast-lord understood what you said.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:28.030
She's usually more obedient,

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.900
but she's in some pain now with the baby about to be born.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.120
So don't startle her too much, okay?

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:39.360
<i>It surprised me when she said she'd go to Kazalm.</i>

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.280
<i>But we're talking about a girl here.</i>

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:45.450
<i>Let her do as she wants for a while, and she'll be satisfied.</i>

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.470
<i>I agree, Father.</i>

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.040
It's unfair.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.590
You're really unfair, Sensei.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.260
Shiron.

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:04.550
I want to study and learn many things, but my father plans upon sending me away as a bride.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.020
Shiron-

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:09.350
I don't want you to console me.

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:13.900
Because nobody listens to me,

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:18.110
yet you can talk to a beast-lord that's not supposed to listen to any human.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.610
A person like that can never understand my feelings!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.460
Shiron...

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.130
What's happening?

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.090
It's coming out.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.570
Coming out?

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:47.950
Shiron.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.600
Go get Esal-sensei for me.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.850
And have Tomura-sensei make some hot water.

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:56.870
Have Nukku-san and Mokku-san get new straw bedding.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:14:59.860
Hurry up!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:01.540
Y-Yes!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.070
Lilan!  Be strong!

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:07.940
Erin.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:10.290
Esal-sensei!

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.290
I was concerned and came over just now.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:13.740
It's coming out, isn't it?

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:15.650
Well...

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:19.630
Ani, you can't go in!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.010
They shut us out as soon as they were done with us!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.710
Can't we at least peek?

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.800
The way she's in pain...

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.510
It may be in a breech position.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.600
"Breech?"

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.770
We might have to pull it out.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.190
That's impossible.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:38.330
If we use the mute whistle to approach her, Lilan's body won't last.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.580
Then what do we do?

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.970
I'll try doing it myself.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:52.070
That's impossible!  Even for you, you're dealing with an enormous beast-lord!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:53.680
You're done for if it goes wild.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.470
But Lilan's already in labor!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.500
If anything happens, don't hesitate to blow it.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:07.360
Do you understand?

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:10.820
Yes.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.100
Where's Erin-chan?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:15.600
Inside.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.970
Inside?!  No one's going to help her?!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.610
We couldn't even if we wanted to!

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.070
Lilan.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.660
Let's definitely have this baby safe and sound, okay?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.660
I can't!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.910
I'm going to go back and study!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.800
Wait!

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:41.850
At Kazalm, you'll have to face many births and deaths.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:45.800
It's something you'll never learn from books.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.560
Now is that chance to learn.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.010
Now, have a good look.

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:56.430
Just a little more!  You can do it, Lilan!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:02.620
Erin!

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:07.070
Keep it up, Lilan!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.080
Hang in there, Lilan!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.040
Just a little more to go!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.540
Lilan!  Raise your head!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.390
You can't pass out now!

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:28.420
Please!  Raise your head!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:29.000
Tense up!

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:32.990
Lilan!  Please Lilan!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.240
We promised we'd definitely have the baby safe and sound, right?!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.540
Lilan!

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.940
You can do this!

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:48.730
You can do it...

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.170
Lilan...

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.280
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:02.750
You can do it, Lilan!

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:04.880
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:05.930
Erin.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:06.770
You can do it, Lilan!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:07.340
Erin!

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:07.580
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:07.590
Erin-chan!
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:08.700
Little girl!
Erin-chan!
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.900
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.320
Lilan!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.780
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:14.150
You can do it!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:14.670
Erin!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.450
You can do it, Erin-sensei!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.600
Lilan!

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:23.300
Lilan!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:14.480
Shiron.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:21.160
I don't believe Erin became a teacher simply because she had good grades,

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:26.790
nor because of the ability she possesses that others do not, which allowed her to take care of Lilan.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:37.220
She faces straight ahead into life and tries to live with everything she has.

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:43.390
Just like you realized yourself, everyone at Kazalm has acknowledged her for her stance and supported her.

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:46.400
Just as you are.

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:49.570
You don't have to rush.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:54.190
If you always give your best at what you want to do,

00:19:54.710 --> 00:20:01.400
then your father will eventually acknowledge you and give you his support.

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.430
You worked hard, little one.

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:24.030
You worked hard, Lilan.

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.560
Erin-sensei.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:32.540
Why am I crying so much?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:41.510
None of this is written in books.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.350
What's wrong?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.310
We have a message from Kazalm.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:54.650
From Kazalm?

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:56.840
The beast-lord had a baby?!

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:59.220
My, that's wonderful!

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.500
I would love to see the baby with my own eyes.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:06.430
Damiya.  Begin preparing for it.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:07.750
Most certainly.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.800
The Queen's coming to Kazalm?  Really?

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:16.190
A messenger brought this, sometime this morning.

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:19.990
It came along with the name for the newborn beast-lord.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:22.900
It's drinking properly.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.390
What's the name for the baby?

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:27.410
It's Owl.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.120
The Queen provided the name.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.250
Owl.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:36.880
All right, let's clean up the old straw bedding.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:38.550
Erin-sensei.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:39.880
Yes?

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:40.630
Here.

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:43.140
I'll give it to you.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:46.390
That's your precious book, isn't it?

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:47.600
I couldn't take it!

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.710
I want you to have it.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:56.750
I'm going to study things that aren't written in books with you.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:08.700
Then I will hold onto this until which time you need it again.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:10.070
Okay.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:15.340
A new life had been born at Kazalm,

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:20.670
and Shiron, who had been exposed to that new life, began to walk a new path.

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:26.890
As a teacher, Erin took pleasure in that fact.

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:08.830
The day the Queen will come to Kazalm to see Owl has been decided.

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:11.460
But there's a secret at Kazalm.

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:16.630
It's how Erin can communicate with
beast-lords using the harp.

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:19.970
That fact must not be revealed.

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:24.560
Kemono no Souja Erin.  The Queen, Harumiya.

00:24:25.010 --> 00:26:00.030
The Queen, Harumiya
